<title>USA: MEDIQ to post $31.8 mln gain from merger.</title>
<headline>MEDIQ to post $31.8 mln gain from merger.</headline>
<dateline>PENNSAUKEN, N.J. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>MEDIQ Inc said Monday it will realize an after-tax gain of about $31.8 million, or $1.28 per share, from the sale of its interest in PCI Services Inc to Cardinal Health Inc.</p>
<p>MEDIQ owned a substantial interest in PCI Services, which was sold recently to Cardinal Health for about $201 million in a stock swap.</p>
<p>As a result of the merger, MEDIQ will receive 966,000 shares of Cardinal Health stock which, based on Friday's closing price, has a market value of about $79.2 million.</p>
